      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْدَثُ</span></b>  <i>More,</i> and <i>most, new,</i> or <i>recent:</i> fem.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُدْثَى</span>; as in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمْرَأَتِى الحُدْثَى</span>, occurring
in a trad., <i>My wife who was more,</i> or <i>most, recently married.</i> (TA.)

